WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:04.100
For instance,
even if those arms of yours

00:04.100 --> 00:06.940
Become entwined in chains

00:06.940 --> 00:10.370
For instance,
even if this space we live in

00:10.370 --> 00:14.740
Someday will burn completely down

00:14.740 --> 00:20.880
Keep believing in hope, if nothing else

00:22.150 --> 00:26.420
In the shadows of glimmering stars

00:28.220 --> 00:32.490
There is a world governed by darkness

00:34.300 --> 00:38.790
Just one life that is out there

00:40.300 --> 00:45.570
If you keep it entrapped there,
lonely boy

00:46.370 --> 00:52.150
The reason that we met each other here

00:52.150 --> 00:58.490
Must surely exist

00:58.490 --> 01:01.760
For instance,
even if sorrow takes you

01:01.760 --> 01:04.690
And you're about to collapse under it

01:04.690 --> 01:08.030
For instance,
if my chest can become

01:08.030 --> 01:12.400
A power to hold you and keep you there

01:12.400 --> 01:16.800
I'm sure that even
tomorrow we can survive

01:32.490 --> 01:34.220
Just a bit more...

01:34.220 --> 01:35.890
One head taller...

01:35.890 --> 01:37.930
No, if my height changed

01:37.930 --> 01:39.730
even just a little bit,

01:39.730 --> 01:42.160
I should be able to see
completely different scenery.

01:54.680 --> 01:56.080
Don't get in my way!

01:59.850 --> 02:01.550
It's just a little more...

02:01.550 --> 02:03.480
Just a little bit...

02:22.570 --> 02:24.610
This doesn't look like the afterlife...

02:24.610 --> 02:25.740
So what happened?

02:25.740 --> 02:28.440
- I'll check right now.
- W-What's this?

02:30.980 --> 02:32.450
What's going on?

02:32.450 --> 02:34.780
Is the crystal trying to eat this ship?

02:44.030 --> 02:45.010
Jura...

02:47.460 --> 02:48.200
Dita?

02:48.200 --> 02:49.330
Yeah?

02:49.330 --> 02:51.130
Over here...

02:51.130 --> 02:55.700
Something went beep and then whoosh!

02:55.700 --> 02:58.430
Alien power is amazing!

03:09.880 --> 03:12.420
Gascogne, can you cut us off?

03:12.420 --> 03:14.060
Not with the laser beam.

03:14.060 --> 03:17.090
If we don't hurry,
this place'll get swallowed up, too.

03:17.090 --> 03:19.560
The corrosion has spread
throughout the ship.

03:19.560 --> 03:22.960
The engine's dead, too.
It won't move.

03:22.960 --> 03:24.870
So we have to remove
it from the source.

03:24.870 --> 03:25.870
I'm going up.

03:25.870 --> 03:27.840
BC! Parfet! Come with me!

03:27.840 --> 03:28.490
- Roger!
- Roger!

03:35.280 --> 03:37.300
Well, this is amazing!

03:40.580 --> 03:42.180
I'm sorry, Captain.

03:42.180 --> 03:43.920
Making you come all the way up...

03:43.920 --> 03:46.690
You don't need to apologize.

03:46.690 --> 03:48.920
I just wanted to see
it with my own eyes.

03:51.190 --> 03:52.960
The man that Dita was chasing.

03:52.960 --> 03:55.200
It's been a while
since I last saw a man

03:55.200 --> 03:57.530
but did their faces
always look this silly?

04:00.940 --> 04:01.920
What are you?

04:03.100 --> 04:05.010
Me? I'm Hibiki...

04:05.010 --> 04:06.110
Hibiki...

04:06.110 --> 04:09.040
The term for this organic
being or a personal name?

04:09.040 --> 04:10.580
Why are you here?

04:10.580 --> 04:13.620
Is your objective from
instinct or responsibility?

04:13.620 --> 04:14.520
No!

04:14.520 --> 04:16.520
I was just sick of it!

04:16.520 --> 04:19.690
I wanted to escape from
a life where I'd be mocked

04:19.690 --> 04:22.160
just because of how
I look or where I work!

04:22.160 --> 04:23.390
Unable to comprehend.

04:23.390 --> 04:24.890
What is "Hibiki"?

04:24.890 --> 04:26.190
What kind of question is that?

04:26.190 --> 04:27.300
Why do...

04:27.300 --> 04:29.030
...you exist?

04:29.030 --> 04:30.060
Your...

04:30.060 --> 04:33.870
proof that you are you.
What is it?

04:33.870 --> 04:34.900
Proof?

04:34.900 --> 04:36.970
Can't you see it by looking at me?

04:36.970 --> 04:38.640
That answer is primal...

04:38.640 --> 04:39.900
Three-dimensional...

04:41.740 --> 04:43.140
W-Wait a minute...

04:43.140 --> 04:44.410
What are you?

04:44.410 --> 04:45.580
Where are we?

04:45.580 --> 04:46.350
Wait!

04:46.350 --> 04:48.180
What should I do?

04:48.180 --> 04:50.650
I... I...

04:52.450 --> 04:55.420
Ow... Huh?

04:58.430 --> 04:59.960
Man...

04:59.960 --> 05:02.130
Looks like I'm back in prison.

05:02.130 --> 05:03.460
Looks like you've come to.

05:03.460 --> 05:05.030
Who?

05:05.030 --> 05:06.570
Duero Mcfile.

05:06.570 --> 05:09.340
Do you have a name, third class citizen?

05:09.340 --> 05:11.070
Don't mock me!

05:11.070 --> 05:12.810
I'm Hibiki Tokai!

05:12.810 --> 05:15.280
I'm not your typical third class citizen!

05:15.280 --> 05:17.610
You interrupted the ceremony, right?

05:17.610 --> 05:19.080
How did you sneak in?

05:19.080 --> 05:21.220
I'm sure being questioned a lot today...

05:21.220 --> 05:22.620
- Like I said...
- Beep...

05:22.620 --> 05:24.290
Beep. Hm?

05:24.290 --> 05:25.620
Pyoro!

05:25.620 --> 05:27.260
Hm? Where is this?

05:27.260 --> 05:29.490
Who am I?

05:29.490 --> 05:31.820
- Were you like this before?
- Beep.

05:40.600 --> 05:43.300
I'm sure in a big mess now.

05:43.300 --> 05:45.670
What happened to this ship?

05:49.080 --> 05:50.510
D-Dammit, what is this?

05:50.510 --> 05:51.670
Don't surprise me!

05:56.050 --> 05:58.750
O-Oh, hello...

06:02.360 --> 06:03.860
Wow, Ms. Gasco,

06:03.860 --> 06:06.530
We're now connected
from the inside too!

06:06.530 --> 06:07.760
Sheesh...

06:07.760 --> 06:12.030
I didn't think Paksis was
such an amazing energetic force...

06:12.030 --> 06:15.370
And it's not Gasco,
it's Gascogne!

06:15.370 --> 06:16.540
Just as I thought!

06:16.540 --> 06:19.140
It's linked down to our core area!

06:19.140 --> 06:20.270
Search for a route!

06:20.270 --> 06:23.380
Insert Linestar Particles
into the main cable over there!

06:23.380 --> 06:25.780
Just make it so that
we can control this thing!

06:27.380 --> 06:29.020
Paiway!

06:29.020 --> 06:30.450
Let me out of here!

06:30.450 --> 06:31.650
It's cold!

06:31.650 --> 06:33.390
Not until the male germs are gone!

06:33.390 --> 06:34.560
Paiway!

06:34.560 --> 06:39.430
And so, even in this time of crisis,
the super idol Paiway...

06:39.430 --> 06:40.460
P-Pyoro?

06:40.460 --> 06:41.930
Here, I'll fix you up...

06:41.930 --> 06:44.030
Don't make fun of me!
I'm not broken!

06:44.030 --> 06:44.960
No matter how...

06:47.300 --> 06:48.770
W-Woman!

06:48.770 --> 06:51.370
What do you plan to do
by sticking us in here?

06:51.370 --> 06:54.710
This is the safest place,
considering the situation.

06:54.710 --> 06:57.580
You say that, but you're
gonna eat my innards.

06:57.580 --> 07:00.180
Eat your innards?

07:00.180 --> 07:01.440
He really believes it!

07:03.280 --> 07:05.450
I want to ask you a few things first.

07:05.450 --> 07:06.110
Come with me.

07:12.730 --> 07:13.630
What's in there?

07:18.270 --> 07:19.390
What are you doing?

07:20.400 --> 07:22.270
Geez, what was that for?

07:22.270 --> 07:24.940
It was because you
were being rude to a lady.

07:24.940 --> 07:27.340
Don't say things
that don't make sense!

07:27.340 --> 07:29.080
What? Another one?

07:29.080 --> 07:31.850
Yes, he was hiding in the platform.

07:31.850 --> 07:33.280
Oh, comrades.

07:33.280 --> 07:34.550
I'm glad to see you.

07:34.550 --> 07:35.820
Oh my.

07:35.820 --> 07:39.250
I came here to see the prisoners,
but they're all kids!

07:39.250 --> 07:40.860
Hey. Hey.

07:40.860 --> 07:42.060
Interrogation time!

07:42.060 --> 07:43.830
I'll tell you everything!

07:43.830 --> 07:45.330
Oh, how nostalgic!

07:45.330 --> 07:46.890
A navi-robot.

07:46.890 --> 07:50.030
There's still a functioning one I see.

07:50.030 --> 07:51.330
What do you mean?

07:51.330 --> 07:53.170
This is a man's ship!

07:53.170 --> 07:56.500
But it was a colonization
ship before that.

07:56.500 --> 07:59.010
Oh, you don't know anything, do you?

07:59.010 --> 08:03.780
This was one of many ships
that left a planet called Earth.

08:03.780 --> 08:06.710
Of course, that was
before this was cut off.

08:06.710 --> 08:12.490
Your cowardly grandfathers
took it from us and escaped.

08:12.490 --> 08:16.190
They overhauled an old battleship
with residential quarters.

08:16.190 --> 08:19.660
And we are now unexpectedly
back on that battleship.

08:19.660 --> 08:23.060
We'll take this ship since
it's our business,

08:23.060 --> 08:26.870
but the problem is what
to do with all of you.

08:26.870 --> 08:30.000
Let's get rid of them.
The situation is unstable enough.

08:30.000 --> 08:31.610
No need to rush.

08:31.610 --> 08:36.580
We'll carefully consider
how we want to cook them up.

08:36.580 --> 08:38.240
So they are gonna eat us...

08:39.150 --> 08:41.080
Oh no, none of them match.

08:41.080 --> 08:42.620
I don't understand.

08:42.620 --> 08:44.320
You don't understand?

08:44.320 --> 08:47.020
It's an amazing thing
to come across an alien!

08:47.020 --> 08:48.420
But it is amazing.

08:48.420 --> 08:50.690
We thought Paksis was
just an energy source,

08:50.690 --> 08:53.030
but it revamped the entire ship!

08:53.030 --> 08:54.660
Revamped, huh?

08:54.660 --> 08:58.030
If I get abducted...

08:58.030 --> 08:59.100
Ezra, what's wrong?

08:59.100 --> 09:00.940
A fever?

09:00.940 --> 09:04.370
I was just remembering everyone...

09:04.370 --> 09:05.510
That's true...

09:05.510 --> 09:08.610
We left behind all
our veterans at the base.

09:08.610 --> 09:11.610
I hope we get to go back soon.

09:11.610 --> 09:12.350
What?

09:12.350 --> 09:13.110
There! There!

09:13.110 --> 09:13.850
Over there!

09:13.850 --> 09:14.510
Where?

09:16.150 --> 09:19.390
Oh no, what is that?

09:19.390 --> 09:22.220
It has to be a UFO of course!

09:26.260 --> 09:30.100
So that long-haired boy is a doctor,
and the short one...

09:30.100 --> 09:31.200
...is an attacker.

09:31.200 --> 09:33.500
Wait a minute! I'm...

09:33.500 --> 09:34.740
Damn you!

09:34.740 --> 09:37.440
I saw him climbing into
an enemy powered suit.

09:37.440 --> 09:38.040
I see...

09:38.040 --> 09:39.440
W-Wait a min...

09:39.440 --> 09:41.510
Something is approaching us!

09:41.510 --> 09:43.010
- Male reinforcements?
- Actually...

09:43.010 --> 09:44.000
It's a UFO!

09:48.650 --> 09:49.850
They've commenced attack!

09:49.850 --> 09:51.370
The aliens are upset!

09:52.950 --> 09:53.890
What is it now?

09:58.460 --> 10:00.230
Oh, my snack!

10:00.230 --> 10:01.560
Dreads are going out.

10:01.560 --> 10:02.860
Parfet, can we move?

10:02.860 --> 10:05.600
It's impossible! I can't control it!

10:05.600 --> 10:07.930
The only thing that's barely
operating is auto-defense!

10:10.140 --> 10:11.340
Barnette, where are you?

10:11.340 --> 10:14.280
Paiway's locked me in,
and I can't get out.

10:14.280 --> 10:15.640
Ms. Gasco, what about you?

10:15.640 --> 10:18.650
The Dreads have been
swallowed up by Paksis.

10:18.650 --> 10:20.920
Sorry, but we'll
be heading up there, too.

10:20.920 --> 10:22.250
Got it.

10:22.250 --> 10:25.090
And it's not Gasco. It's Gascogne!

10:25.090 --> 10:26.690
Jura! Dita! Where are you?

10:26.690 --> 10:28.090
I'm heading towards the platform now.

10:33.260 --> 10:35.160
Are these really ours?

10:35.160 --> 10:35.960
Wow!

10:44.010 --> 10:45.610
The system hasn't changed too much...

10:45.610 --> 10:46.910
How about you?

10:46.910 --> 10:48.180
It looks like it can fly.

10:48.180 --> 10:50.080
I'm sure that they've been powered up!

10:50.080 --> 10:51.380
I'm so excited!

10:51.380 --> 10:53.180
Just don't go out of your league.

10:53.180 --> 10:54.180
Got that?

10:54.180 --> 10:54.670
Roger!

11:02.590 --> 11:06.490
I'm from a peaceful race!

11:06.490 --> 11:08.390
Listen to what I have to say!

11:10.430 --> 11:12.500
Dita, they're all enemies...

11:12.500 --> 11:14.230
But was she that good a pilot?

11:17.810 --> 11:19.070
What's with this response?

11:19.640 --> 11:21.140
It sure is an unknown enemy.

11:21.140 --> 11:22.140
It isn't men!

11:22.140 --> 11:23.180
I know!

11:23.180 --> 11:25.210
Those are evil aliens!

11:25.210 --> 11:25.940
These are...

11:33.550 --> 11:35.090
What is that system?

11:35.090 --> 11:36.750
Are they really aliens?

11:42.460 --> 11:45.900
- Crew has completed the move.
- Where is this?

11:45.900 --> 11:48.000
BC, I'm leaving the bridge to you.

11:48.000 --> 11:49.130
Right!

11:50.440 --> 11:51.570
Hold on!

11:51.570 --> 11:52.970
I'll help you!

11:52.970 --> 11:54.440
Don't move her!

11:54.440 --> 11:56.770
Don't worry! I'm a doctor!

11:58.610 --> 12:00.950
I just want to see my patient.

12:00.950 --> 12:02.320
You, help me.

12:02.320 --> 12:02.980
Right!

12:06.520 --> 12:09.890
It looks like you need our help.

12:09.890 --> 12:12.090
It's true that we are enemies.

12:12.090 --> 12:15.200
But under these circumstances,

12:15.200 --> 12:16.930
survival must come first.

12:16.930 --> 12:20.330
Well, you know,
I am actually a helmsman.

12:20.330 --> 12:23.170
Oh? You, a steersman?

12:23.170 --> 12:24.270
Warning! Warning!

12:24.270 --> 12:25.740
This guy sounds like bogus!

12:25.740 --> 12:27.240
You stay quiet.

12:27.240 --> 12:28.340
Sorry.

12:28.340 --> 12:30.710
So, what do you want to say?

12:30.710 --> 12:34.520
Well, right now we
can call a cease-fire.

12:34.520 --> 12:37.280
And provide each other with
what the other doesn't have...

12:37.280 --> 12:39.920
We can momentarily gather all forces,
and get over this crisis.

12:39.920 --> 12:41.320
I believe that would be wise...

12:41.320 --> 12:42.720
I see...

12:42.720 --> 12:45.430
That's not a bad idea.

12:45.430 --> 12:47.860
I thank you for your wise decision.

12:47.860 --> 12:50.700
So, should we shake on it...

12:50.700 --> 12:52.430
I have no wish to be chummy.

12:52.430 --> 12:55.600
I'll still be treating
you as a prisoner.

12:55.600 --> 12:58.410
- Understandable.
- It's impossible here.

12:58.410 --> 12:59.870
I'm taking her to sick bay.

12:59.870 --> 13:00.610
All right.

13:00.610 --> 13:03.010
You, come with me to the bridge.

13:03.010 --> 13:05.210
BC, take the attacker to the warehouse.

13:05.210 --> 13:06.010
Right.

13:10.550 --> 13:12.220
There's no end to them!

13:12.220 --> 13:14.560
- We have to get the main system!
- I know,

13:14.560 --> 13:16.350
but if our flagship moves at all...

13:18.530 --> 13:21.400
It looks like it'll be
a while before it stabilizes.

13:21.400 --> 13:24.970
I guess when the enemy
attack supersedes this change

13:24.970 --> 13:27.370
it'll be the end for us.

13:27.370 --> 13:28.970
H-Hey...

13:28.970 --> 13:30.170
What?

13:30.170 --> 13:33.840
I came all the way here
without saying anything,

13:33.840 --> 13:35.010
but I'll confess.

13:35.010 --> 13:37.880
Actually, I'm not
a Vanguard pilot at all...

13:39.350 --> 13:41.780
I'm just a parts mechanic.

13:41.780 --> 13:44.950
I didn't have the nerve
to explain during this mess.

13:44.950 --> 13:45.720
I see.

13:45.720 --> 13:47.250
Then why are you here?

13:47.250 --> 13:49.820
I don't know that myself.

13:49.820 --> 13:50.490
But,

13:50.490 --> 13:53.690
I got suckered into something stupid;

13:53.690 --> 13:55.790
Stealing one of the Vanguards.

13:57.600 --> 13:58.870
Geez...

13:58.870 --> 14:00.100
If you think about it...

14:00.100 --> 14:01.970
I guess our data was incorrect.

14:01.970 --> 14:04.610
I had heard that men were a proud race,

14:04.610 --> 14:08.680
but to think that they
were such pathetic beings.

14:08.680 --> 14:10.180
No matter what the reason,

14:10.180 --> 14:12.280
aren't you here for your pride?

14:12.280 --> 14:16.880
No, to show proof of your existence?

14:16.880 --> 14:19.220
Male or female, it doesn't matter now.

14:19.220 --> 14:22.290
Under these conditions, as a human,

14:22.290 --> 14:23.990
as a lifeform,

14:23.990 --> 14:25.660
while there are people

14:25.660 --> 14:28.130
desperately trying to overcome this crisis,

14:28.130 --> 14:32.830
you're going to curl up and just
wait for the final moments to come?

14:32.830 --> 14:34.770
What are you trying to make up for?

14:34.770 --> 14:37.340
Who do you think you're fooling?

14:37.340 --> 14:39.210
No matter how pathetic,

14:39.210 --> 14:41.110
no matter how ugly,

14:41.110 --> 14:44.980
if you cower at the obstacle before you,
nothing will change.

14:44.980 --> 14:47.050
Your life will end without change.

14:47.050 --> 14:48.040
Isn't that so?

14:51.590 --> 14:52.450
But...

14:52.450 --> 14:53.920
I don't know.

14:53.920 --> 14:56.410
I don't know what to do myself!

14:59.730 --> 15:01.900
I guess I wasted my breath.

15:01.900 --> 15:03.260
Let's go to the bridge.

15:03.260 --> 15:03.830
But...

15:03.830 --> 15:05.600
Don't worry.

15:05.600 --> 15:09.370
This guy has nowhere to run now.

15:09.370 --> 15:11.630
And neither do we.

15:15.040 --> 15:16.180
What is this?

15:16.180 --> 15:19.050
The bridge has been pulled
out all the way here.

15:19.050 --> 15:19.910
Amazing!

15:19.910 --> 15:22.410
Now show us what you can do.

15:23.580 --> 15:24.880
Geez, this is dangerous!

15:28.790 --> 15:30.160
What is this?

15:30.160 --> 15:30.930
What?

15:30.930 --> 15:33.430
Are you saying you
don't know what it is?

15:33.430 --> 15:34.900
What are you talking about?

15:34.900 --> 15:37.130
This is one of our
of our army's secret weapons.

15:37.130 --> 15:38.400
Uh, here.

15:38.400 --> 15:39.530
L-L-Like this...

15:42.840 --> 15:44.070
Oh my.

15:44.070 --> 15:45.840
This is some secret weapon!

15:45.840 --> 15:47.170
He doesn't get it at all!

15:52.280 --> 15:54.580
W-W-What the hell is this?

16:01.690 --> 16:02.820
Oh, it moved!

16:02.820 --> 16:04.020
Pyoro!

16:09.760 --> 16:10.920
Offline, as I thought.

16:12.400 --> 16:14.970
Then we have to do it my way...

16:14.970 --> 16:16.440
Pai! Where are you, Pai?

16:17.400 --> 16:20.710
- It hurts...
- Paiway hurry...

16:20.710 --> 16:21.440
Geez!

16:21.440 --> 16:22.930
Stop getting hurt, all of you!

16:26.250 --> 16:26.970
Stay away!

16:32.150 --> 16:34.360
The enemy's main system is approaching!

16:34.360 --> 16:36.760
Meia's group is coming
in the middle to help out

16:36.760 --> 16:38.590
but it's no good!

16:38.590 --> 16:40.090
Do you think we can get away?

16:40.090 --> 16:43.230
Who knows what could happen?

16:43.230 --> 16:44.570
Port engine hit!

16:44.570 --> 16:45.900
The shield won't last!

16:45.900 --> 16:48.370
We can't regroup under all this pressure.

16:48.370 --> 16:49.870
Hey, can you hear me?

16:49.870 --> 16:51.140
Take this thing off me!

16:51.140 --> 16:52.940
I can't move like this!

16:52.940 --> 16:55.080
What does he mean?

16:55.080 --> 16:56.540
Leave it to me.

16:56.540 --> 16:57.780
What's your plan?

16:57.780 --> 17:00.680
I'm gonna fight with you, of course!

17:00.680 --> 17:02.780
Fight? You?

17:02.780 --> 17:04.790
It's true that I'm pathetic.

17:04.790 --> 17:06.150
That I'm not cool.

17:06.150 --> 17:09.190
But I've already gotten sick of that me!

17:09.190 --> 17:10.590
Is that a man's nature?

17:10.590 --> 17:12.260
Or are you just rebelling?

17:12.260 --> 17:13.130
That's not it!

17:13.130 --> 17:15.300
At least for now, that's not it!

17:15.300 --> 17:16.600
It's to be strong!

17:16.600 --> 17:18.430
And for me...

17:18.430 --> 17:20.420
...to prove my own existence!

17:23.900 --> 17:24.710
All right!

17:24.710 --> 17:26.200
I'll make this count!

17:28.580 --> 17:30.740
The enemy response is increasing.

17:30.740 --> 17:32.550
All we can do is defend.

17:32.550 --> 17:34.380
Reinforcements are en route.

17:34.380 --> 17:36.850
Although I have no idea what may happen.

17:36.850 --> 17:37.910
Reinforcements?

17:39.520 --> 17:40.920
Sorry to keep you waiting, partn...

17:48.360 --> 17:49.530
Partner...

17:49.530 --> 17:51.600
This is you, right?

17:51.600 --> 17:53.500
So you've changed, too?

17:53.500 --> 17:54.740
Then...

17:54.740 --> 17:56.000
I have to change, too!

17:58.910 --> 18:01.340
Damn it, I won't let it end like this.

18:01.340 --> 18:02.840
Even if I don't know how to move this,

18:02.840 --> 18:05.450
I'll make it move with my spirit!

18:05.450 --> 18:06.110
No way.

18:10.050 --> 18:12.090
W-What's going on?

18:12.090 --> 18:13.520
I can do this!

18:17.830 --> 18:20.950
I'll pay back everything
right now all in one shot!

18:36.180 --> 18:37.040
Stay back!

18:37.040 --> 18:39.550
Go away! Damn you!

18:39.550 --> 18:41.050
What is that?

18:41.050 --> 18:42.220
Leader, did you see?

18:42.220 --> 18:44.180
It's that alien!

18:44.180 --> 18:45.850
That's our reinforcements?

18:49.520 --> 18:52.490
Damn it, you're doing whatever you want...

18:53.830 --> 18:55.900
All right, I'm getting the hang of this!

18:55.900 --> 18:56.760
Take this!

18:56.760 --> 18:58.660
Lightning Flight Fist!

19:02.970 --> 19:04.240
No weapons.

19:04.240 --> 19:05.570
Then take this!

19:12.110 --> 19:14.550
The enemy's main system
has stopped moving.

19:14.550 --> 19:16.280
It's heading toward the Vanguard.

19:16.280 --> 19:18.750
It doesn't look
like he'll live too long.

19:18.750 --> 19:19.850
Yes.

19:19.850 --> 19:22.420
But if he manages to live through this,

19:22.420 --> 19:25.650
common sense may be turned upside-down.

19:27.430 --> 19:29.360
Amazing!

19:29.360 --> 19:30.530
Dita, pull back!

19:30.530 --> 19:32.170
There's no reason to worry!

19:32.170 --> 19:34.940
Mr. Alien's doing this for us!

19:34.940 --> 19:36.070
I know it!

19:36.070 --> 19:37.240
Dita!

19:37.240 --> 19:39.010
I'm gonna pull ahead.

19:39.010 --> 19:40.840
I won't let anyone get in my way!

19:42.440 --> 19:43.100
Dita!

19:46.050 --> 19:47.610
Just a bit more...

19:47.610 --> 19:49.220
I'm so close!

19:49.220 --> 19:51.220
I want power!

19:51.220 --> 19:53.850
I want enough power
to take that one last step!

19:55.360 --> 19:56.290
Mr. Alien!

19:56.290 --> 19:57.520
I won't lose!

20:01.860 --> 20:02.990
That idiot...

20:05.230 --> 20:08.740
It looks like a miracle didn't happen.

20:08.740 --> 20:10.270
All hands, abandon...

20:10.270 --> 20:10.700
Beep!

20:25.190 --> 20:25.980
- What
- is that?

20:28.020 --> 20:30.690
Is that another secret
weapon that the men had?

20:30.690 --> 20:31.730
Impossible...

20:31.730 --> 20:32.780
Is this a miracle?

21:05.260 --> 21:06.420
I got here...

21:07.860 --> 21:09.020
I finally...

21:13.500 --> 21:16.940
W-What's going on here?

21:16.940 --> 21:20.240
You're amazing, Mr. Alien...

21:21.480 --> 21:24.070
Is this my proof of existence?

21:32.020 --> 21:37.620
Hey, you realized what the words,

21:37.620 --> 21:43.130
I really wanted to hear are, right?

21:43.130 --> 21:49.370
I was looking at your profile as
you talked about the distant future.

21:49.370 --> 21:59.680
Take me with you to the depths of dreams.

21:59.680 --> 22:02.220
Hey, with all of my body.

22:02.220 --> 22:13.990
A pistol named love shoots
through the center of my chest.

22:13.990 --> 22:25.610
Negotiations and common
sense hold no meaning at all.

22:25.610 --> 22:37.420
Pull the trigger named love and
shoot through my frozen heart.

22:37.420 --> 22:51.290
Pour in your love
to the tips of my fingers.
